  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If the etag value is returned to the server in If-Match without the quotes, then the server raises an uncaught exception:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "$ curl -XPUT ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/foo"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/foo",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/foo"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/foo",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "$ curl -I ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/foo"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/foo",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "...",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "ETag: \"2c35ae443a20eac5e1cc44d451371485a6e6ff4f\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "...",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "$ curl -XPUT -H \"If-Match: 2c35ae443a20eac5e1cc44d451371485a6e6ff4f\" ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/foo"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/foo",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "...",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "org.glassfish.jersey.message.internal.HeaderValueException: Unable to parse \"If-Match\" header value: \"2c35ae443a20eac5e1cc44d451371485a6e6ff4f\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.glassfish.jersey.message.internal.InboundMessageContext.exception(InboundMessageContext.java:333)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It could give 400 or 412, preferably with a nice error message saying that the quotes are needed.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
